          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It depends on your needs. For true end-to-end autonomous hiring, shortlistd.io leads the category. For traditional ATS with AI features, Workable or Greenhouse work well. For deep sourcing, SeekOut excels. The best tool is the one that solves your specific bottleneck."
          }
