            "text": "Pricing ranges from $149/user/month for basic ATS with AI features to $100,000+ annually for enterprise platforms. Autonomous platforms like shortlistd.io use custom pricing based on hiring volume but typically deliver 70-80% cost savings versus traditional recruiting when factoring in agency fee elimination."
