          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What's the difference between autonomous AI and regular AI recruiting tools?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Regular AI tools assist with specific tasks like resume parsing or email generation. Autonomous AI uses coordinated agents that execute entire workflows end-to-end with minimal human intervention—from candidate sourcing through interview delivery."
