          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does it take to implement AI recruiting software?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Implementation timelines vary: Simple tools like Paradox or scheduling take 1-2 weeks. ATS replacements like Workable take 4-8 weeks. Autonomous platforms like shortlistd.io take 2-6 weeks depending on deployment model. Enterprise suites like Eightfold take 3-6 months."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What ROI should I expect from AI recruiting software?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Organizations typically report 40-60% reduction in time-to-hire, 30-75% decrease in cost-per-hire, 3-10x increase in recruiter productivity, and 70-100% reduction in agency dependency. Actual ROI depends on your current costs, hiring volume, and which tool you choose."
          }
        }
